---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import WikiTOC from "../../../components/WikiTOC.astro";
import WikiInfoBox from "../../../components/WikiInfoBox.astro";
import WikiAccordion from "../../../components/WikiAccordion.astro";
import WikiGallery from "../../../components/WikiGallery.astro";
import { getWikiEntry } from "../../../data/wikiEntries";

const wikiEntry = getWikiEntry("wyvern-embers");
---
<!-- Load Base Layout -->
<BaseLayout title="Wiki - RaccStarLogan" description="A collection of information about me, my work, and other random stuff.">
  <meta slot="head" name="wiki:type" content={wikiEntry.meta.type.toLowerCase()} />
  <meta slot="head" name="wiki:tags" content={wikiEntry.meta.tags.join(",")} />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wiki.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href={wikiEntry.stylesheet} />
  <div class="wiki-page-grid">
        <aside class="wiki-sidebar">
      <h2>Info box</h2>
      <WikiGallery
        ariaLabel="Wyvern Embers Gallery"
        images={[
          {
            src: "https://media.raccstarlogan.com/wiki/assets/wyvern.png",
            alt: "Wyvern Embers",
            caption: "Old design sketch of Wyvern. To be updated with a proper gallery and up-to-date design later."
          }
        ]} />
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th>Aliases / Nicknames</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>@reddyfreddy67</li>
                <li>Vern</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Birthday</th>
            <td>October 2, 2000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Gender</th>
            <td>Male</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Pronouns</th>
            <td>he/him</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Height</th>
            <td>5 ft 11 in / 180 cm</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Orientation</th>
            <td>Pansexual</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Species</th>
            <td>Dragon/Cat Hybrid</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Occupations</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li><a href="/wiki/aps">APS</a> Member</li>
                <li>Bowling Alley Manager (Part Time)</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Residence</th>
            <td>Ashford, Texaria</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Hobbies</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>Bowling</li>
                <li>Ghost Hunting</li>
                <li>Urban Exploration</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Favorite Foods</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>Seafood</li>
                <li><a href="/wiki/pearbys">Pearby's</a></li>
                <li>New Dork-style Pizza</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Likes</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>Horror Movies</li>
                <li>Abandoned Things</li>
                <li>Video Games</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Dislikes</th>
            <td>
              <ul>
                <li>Law Enforcement</li>
                <li>Fences</li>
                <li>Pickles</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <br/>
      <h2>More links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={wikiEntry.href + "/gallery"}>Gallery</a></li>
        {wikiEntry.referencePackUrl && (
          <li><a href={wikiEntry.referencePackUrl} download>{wikiEntry.referencePackLabel ?? "Download References (.zip)"}</a></li>
        )}
      </ul>
    </aside>

        <main id="wiki-content" class="article-section">
    <h1>Wyvern Embers</h1>

    <WikiInfoBox title="Quote" variant="info">
      <p>"I'm 'verning it"</p>
      <p class="wiki-gallery-caption">- Wyvern</p>
    </WikiInfoBox>

    <p><strong>Wyvern</strong> <i>(pronounced "whiv-urn")</i> is the guy who pokes ghosts with a stick to see what happens. He's the type of guy to walk into an abandoned factory at 2 in the morning with a camcorder in one hand and a half-eaten shrimp taco in the other. A proud member of the <a href="/wiki/aps">Ashford Paranormal Society (APS)</a>, Wyvern somehow manages to be both the instigator and the guy holding the flashlight. He leans into chaos without really thinking twice, and while he might not take everything seriously, he never backs down when things get weird.</p>

    <div class="wiki-toc-wrapper"><WikiTOC /></div>

    <h2 id="section-1">Appearance</h2>
    <p>PENDING REDESIGN</p>

    <h2 id="section-2">Personality</h2>
    <p>Wyvern comes off loud, but he rarely says much about himself. He's quick with a joke, rarely serious, and usually has a sarcastic take ready for whatever's going on. If something awkward happens, odds are he's the one that caused it; either it be on purpose or because he wasn't paying attention.</p>
    <p>He's the type to fill the silence with noise: commentary, side-eye, or a dry one-liner. But underneath it, he pays closer to attention than people give him credit for. He avoids vulnerability like the plague but cares more than he lets on. If you need someone to laugh with at 3 in the morning or walk into a haunted building just because, he's probably already outside waiting for you to catch up.</p>

    <h2 id="section-3">History</h2>
    <p>Wyvern was born in (note to self come up with an in universe equivelant of Brooklyn, NY) before moving down to <a href="/wiki/ashford">Ashford</a>, <a href="/wiki/texaria">Texaria</a> halfway through elementary school.</p>
    <p>Back in school, he had a brief stint as an internet troll. Not the malicious kind, just the "spends too much time on forums pissing people off" kind. He doesn't bring it up often, but every now and then someone recognizes his username and he has to deny everything with a straight face, at least as straight as he can keep it.</p>
    <p>His history is unremarkable for the most part, other than the fact that he's always been drawn to the weird and spooky. He was the kid who would dare his friends to go into the woods at night, and as he got older, that curiosity only grew stronger. Joining the APS was a natural fit for him, and he's been an active member ever since, always on the lookout for the next big paranormal adventure.</p>

    <h2 id="section-4">Abilities</h2>
    <p>TODO</p>

    <h2 id="section-5">Relationships</h2>
    <p>TODO</p>

    <h2 id="section-6">Trivia</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Some people have compared him to <a href="https://www.twitch.tv/jerma985" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Twitch streamer Jerma985</a>.</li>
      <li>He owns a Ouija board. He doesn't know how to spell or pronounce Ouija so he says it different every time.</li>
      <li>He likes to try and piss off any sorts of paranormal entities he encounters, even if he knows it means nothing but trouble.</li>
      <li>His favorite Pearby's order is just three appetizers and a water.</li>
      <li>Wyvern was not responsible for the events of September 15, 2018.</li>
      <li>
        This was his favorite song of all time for a while:
        <div class="wiki-infobox" style="width:320px; height:180px; padding:0; margin:0;">
          <span class="fr-video fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable" contenteditable="false">
            <iframe width="320" height="180" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UnvHMstK1NI?si=SP9YVai0CZW6CeQT" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          </span>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <br/>
  </main>
</div>
</BaseLayout>










